      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Conversion Factors\n\n- 1 m² = 10.764 ft²\n- 1 ft² = 0.0929 m²\n\n## Occupancy Rate\n\nOccupancy Rate is the maximum number of persons per area unit.\n\nIf the minimum area per person is 100 sq ft, the occupancy rate is 1/100 = 0.01 person per sq.ft, or 10 persons per 1000 sq.ft.\n\n**Note!** - Be aware of local restrictions, codes and their minimum values. They may diverge considerably from the numbers above."
